15: // ALE-398: the Beginners' Workshop flow end to end, from scheduling to
16: // Invitation. Named harness scenarios (`Dhc.E2EHarness.BeginnersWorkshops`)
17: // stand in for the clock — the 10:00 Batch pass and the workshop day — and
18: // for Stripe's payment UI: creation uses the real test API, while the SDK
19: // is stubbed to exercise mounting and the completion callback in place.
20: //
21: // A Batch takes the oldest waiting people first and each workshop seats
22: // one person, so every person here is seeded with a priority older than
23: // anyone else the run creates: the Batch contacts exactly them.
24: 
